{
  "_comment": [
    "SOURCE OF TRUTH for the Makkah / Madinah camera presets.",
    "Edit THIS file, then run `npm run build:makkah-presets` to regenerate",
    "src/data/makkahPresets.generated.js. Never hand-edit the generated file.",
    "",
    "Every `query` is geocoded against OpenStreetMap Nominatim BOUNDED to the",
    "preset's region box, because the unbounded names collide: plain",
    "'العزيزية' resolves to the Al-Aziziyah in TAIF, not the Makkah district.",
    "",
    "Per-place overrides are optional:",
    "  structureHeight — height of the built landmark's visual centre above ITS",
    "                    OWN ground, in metres. Districts leave it at 0; a tower",
    "                    needs it or the camera targets the pavement.",
    "  heading         — fixed camera bearing where one framing is clearly right",
    "                    (0=N, 90=E, 180=S, 270=W). Omitted = north-up.",
    "  radius          — subject radius in metres, overriding the OSM extent.",
    "                    REQUIRED for anything mapped as an OSM node (every",
    "                    summit here): Nominatim hands a node a placeholder box",
    "                    with nothing to do with the real subject's size.",
    "  pitch, range    — hard overrides that switch OFF auto-framing for that",
    "                    place. Use sparingly; the extent-based default is better",
    "                    than a guess for anything area-shaped."
  ],
